      "instance_name": "outrage",
      "label": "outrageous emotion",
      "description": "The emotion of outrage is expressed through the juxtaposition of historical KKK violence and contemporary Black-on-Black violence, aiming to provoke strong emotional reactions by creating a false equivalence that minimizes systemic racism and incites racial division.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
